ry Mode<br></li><li> 4 playable characters to choose from, each with unique backstories to uncover<br></li><li> Leap through a variety of vibrant levels across space and time<br></li><li> Discover a diverse arsenal of weapons to master<br></li><li> Maximise your high score with chain shots and on-site explosives<br></li><li> Dodge, duck, and manipulate physics-based objects for tactical advantages <br></li><li> Formidable boss battles and endless enemies with unique combat patterns<br></li><li> Enjoy thrilling VR arcade action tailored to you, with a range of accessibility settings</li></ul>",
